{"reviews":[{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-0","r":5.0,"t":"Big difference!","x":"I saw after about two days a big difference in the circumference of my sunken in eyes. I noticed most, less outlined undereye age circles. You need to be consistent though. Use immediately after shower, and for consecutive days. I was so shocked at results i began using it for laugh lines, and also saw a great improvement. I highly recommend. Takes years off!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great for reducing puffiness and dark circles","x":"I love this eye cream so far! I have tried it for a few days, and so far it has helped with reducing under eye puffiness, and helps brighten the dark under eyes I have in the mornings. I love to apply this first thing in the morning because it makes my under eyes look so much better, and provides a great base to start applying makeup l.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Not bad","x":"This burns a little at first, and it has a lot of ingredients.  It doesn't seem to do much for my dark circles directly (hydration, allergy medicine and sleep only work here), but the product makes me look less tired and \"brightens\" my eyes.  This is worth a try, maybe you will be pleased with the results.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Eyelushes","x":"Love it! I have bad dark circles & they are slightly lightening","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-4","r":2.0,"t":"Did nothin' fer me","x":"After a month of use, no noticeable changes. I primarily was hoping for lessening of bags under eyes, but I'm still packed and ready for my trip to old-lady-ville. Oh well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Absolutely love it","x":"[[VIDEOID:e5e72e1faa3a67b6ea4e2f51d5a3cb6f]]","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-6","r":3.0,"t":"So-so, not impressed","x":"For me, this wasn't worth the price. The area around my eyes is often puffy and I frequently have dark circles, so I was motivated to try something new. This product was disappointing, because I haven't noticed any difference after a few weeks of daily use. I get far more noticeable results using my old go-to products and getting a good night's sleep. IMO nothing beats a cool compress, good moisturizer, and most importantly, good sinus drainage and a night of deep sleep.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-7","r":5.0,"t":"This cream worked on my dark circles","x":"I used this cream to get rid of my dark circles. I have tried many creams and some work a little, most do not work at all. I was surprised to see this work so well and almost immediately. I use it most days only once a day and it lightens my dark circles considerably. While some products irritated my skin, this did  product did not.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Definitely worth the money!!!","x":"Usually I am very skeptical when it comes to beauty products claiming to do what they say.  But I was extremely and pleasantly surprised that this is one product that does deliver.  I noticed a marked change in the dark circles under my eyes where now they are hardly noticeable.  I would definitely recommend this product!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Definitely worth the money!!!","x":"Usually I am very skeptical when it comes to beauty products claiming to do what they say.  But I was extremely and pleasantly surprised that this is one product that does deliver.  I noticed a marked change in the dark circles under my eyes where now they are hardly noticeable.  I would definitely recommend this product!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-10","r":5.0,"t":"So far, so good","x":"This is a really nice product. I just got it today, but it seemed to help my dark circles almost as soon as it dried. They're not gone, but they're faded out in comparison to before I used this product. I'm anxious to see what it will do with extended use.....","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-11","r":5.0,"t":"The best I\u2019ve tried!","x":"I\u2019ve purchased several brands of caffeine cream for under my eyes, this is definitely the best and I will be buying this again! I like the pump bottle and that I can see how much cream is left in the bottle. My husband uses this product too!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-12","r":5.0,"t":"IT Works","x":"I love the fact that it works.. I was skeptical applying something so close to my eyes but within a few weeks my friend noticed an improvement, the black circles weren\u2019t as dark. Thanks","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-13","r":5.0,"t":"Does not irritate eyes at all","x":"I like that it has caffeine as an ingredient, for my dark circles. Easy  pump for easy application. I would buy CITYGOO Eye Cream Anti-aging again. Really good product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Dark circles gone!!","x":"Unbelievable! I love the difference I see in the mirror!  The dark circles almost disappear with this product. The container has a pump that makes it very easy to use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great product that actually works!","x":"I really liked the clean smell and the application of the cream was easy to administer.  This cream did bring down the puffiness around my eyes.  Will buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-16","r":5.0,"t":"It's Been Working!","x":"I've tried this product for a week now and I do see a difference with the puffiness under my eyes! This cream is lightweight and not greasy at all.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-17","r":3.0,"t":"*updated review","x":"Haven\u2019t seen or felt a difference yet. Hopeful. Will update in 3 months.  **update 6/2/22 - didn\u2019t notice any difference. Used entire product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"This eye cream is easy to use and yo can the the results from the very first day. I must have and easy to carry on your pocket.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-19","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"Great product for the price! Use it every day to help with dark circles and it works so well, my husband sneaks some too.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-20","r":5.0,"t":"Moisturizing","x":"Feels very moisturizing under the eyes. I\u2019ve only been using it for a few days but overall I really like the product","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-21","r":5.0,"t":"Looks to be very effective","x":"I noticed improvement in the dark circles and bags under my eyes, almost immediately.  This is a good solid product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-22","r":4.0,"t":"I am very happy with the product","x":"This is a good product. Clean application that doesn\u2019t leave gooey mess on application dispenser.  Not sticky.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-23","r":1.0,"t":"No noticeable change","x":"I have been using this product twice daily for 3 weeks and I have not noticed any change to my dark circles.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08ZRYWRSQ-24","r":5.0,"t":"Worked for me...","x":"For the price this is a good eye cream.  Reduces the puffiness under my eyes after use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report that the cream reduces or lightens their dark circles, often noticing results within days to a few weeks.","cites":[2,4,8,9,10,11,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the product helps with under-eye puffiness and makes them look less tired or brighter.","cites":[2,3,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers report no noticeable change after weeks of daily use, particularly for under-eye bags.","cites":[5,7]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the pump bottle makes application easy and convenient.","cites":[12,14,15]},{"text":"One reviewer notes a slight burning sensation at first, and another says it did not irritate their eyes.","cites":[3,14]}]},"qa":[]}